      "",
      "Bless Castle is a castle located in the middle of",
      "a small Island under the sea of south location of",
      "Tempskron's territory, the Bamboo forest.",
      "Elliot Bless, who is the origin of the Bless ",
      "dynasty, and his subordinate Arjen DeVaan has built ",
      "the castle and it reflects the techmology of ",
      "the Tempskrons. ",
      "",
      "Nobody can move in the castle except for the ",
      "clan members who own the castle."
